<title>SPAIN: A.Dominguez recoups some opening losses.</title>
<headline>A.Dominguez recoups some opening losses.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Spain's Adolfo Dominguez recovered from an opening low on Thursday to trade down 140 pesetas, or 2.77 percent, to 4,920 pesetas a share.</p>
<p>The fashion house, which had its debut share listing on Tuesday following a successful initial public offer, had opened down 7.11 percent at 4,700.</p>
<p>The shares were sold at 3,100 pesetas each.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
